<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">marra</span></b> , ae, f.
		etym. unknown, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sort of hoe for tearing up weeds, a
			weeding-hook</i>, = ligo (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tu penitus latis eradere viscera marris Ne
					dubita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					10, 72</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. 10, 89</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
				21, 35, § 159</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 15,
				166</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a hook</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(Silurus) in Danubio marris extrahitur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 14, 17, § 45</span></i>
			. 
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
